<title>BELARUS: Belarus rouble unchanged at 14,800 in Minsk.</title>
<headline>Belarus rouble unchanged at 14,800 in Minsk.</headline>
<dateline>MINSK 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Belarussian rouble was unchanged at 14,800 per dollar on the Minsk Interbank Currency Exchange.</p>
<p>				    October 16	    October 15</p>
<p> Rate to dollar		    14,800		  14,800</p>
<p> Volume traded		  $1.443 million	    $2.253 million</p>
<p>--Kiev newsroom, +380 44 229 2264</p>
